# Files that must NOT be uploaded to Vercel.
#
# Keep this list conservative. `lib/` and `api/` are runtime code — never add
# them here. A missing lib/ module does not fail the build, it fails at runtime
# on a cold start (ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND), which is how a broken deployment can
# look "successful" in the Vercel dashboard while every request 500s.
#
# scripts/verify-module-graph.mjs (run in CI and by `npm test`) enforces that
# every require()/import of a local file resolves to a tracked, non-empty file.

node_modules
.git
.github
.env
.env.local
*.log
.DS_Store
